              "value": "Determine the analysis date range for work orders based on the user's input `{{$context.$system.$inputMessage}}`\n- Today, current date : {{$context.$system.$currentDate}} \n\n-**Build dateRange**\n- If no duration is specified, default `StartDate` to the past 90 days(current date - 90) and `EndDate` as Today\n- Output dates in YYYY-MM-DD format only.\n"
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"limit\": { \"type\": \"number\" },\n    \"dateRange\": {\n      \"type\": \"array\",\n      \"items\": {\n        \"type\": \"object\",\n        \"properties\": {\n          \"StartDate\": { \"type\": \"string\", \"format\": \"date\" },\n          \"EndDate\":   { \"type\": \"string\", \"format\": \"date\" }\n        },\n        \"required\": [\"StartDate\", \"EndDate\"],\n        \"additionalProperties\": false\n      }\n    }\n  },\n  \"additionalProperties\": false\n}",
